  "title": "Lazy Day Croatian Lentil Curry",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Croatian-inspired lentil curry made with panang curry paste and flambe, perfect for a sick day. This plant-based dish is cooked in a tandoor clay pot for added flavor.",
