  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the panang curry paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rinsed lentils, chopped carrots, and chopped potatoes, and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut milk and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Flambe the curry by adding a small amount of oil to the pot and igniting it.",
    "Let the curry simmer for an additional 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
